  {
   "role": "assistant",
   "text": "Shortly before the incident, a deployment of checkout-svc version 1.8.2 (commit c736e86) was made at 2026-11-26T18:01:52.288Z. This deployment changed the payment-svc base URL from 18102 to 18112 in config/checkout-svc.yaml. The most likely cause of the failures is that the new port (18112) was not running on the payment-svc sidecar, causing payment calls to time out after 2000ms. Evidence: deploy:d-799, build:b-1276, commit:c736e86, log:655a1622d0, log:891b10c273, log:bed0c004cd",
